{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>School Night S\u00e9ance</strong> is a modern take on the point and click adventure genre. A pair of best friends; the impulsive Melony, and the practical Letty, find themselves separated in a haunted mansion after performing an ill-advised s\u00e9ance. The girls will need to work together to solve puzzles, uncover the mansion\u2019s mysterious history, and finally, reunite and escape the house!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991650/extras/dc14478af848369e15cb5c2f7db25944.poster.avif?t=1757354748\" width=1170 height=654 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991650/extras/dc14478af848369e15cb5c2f7db25944.webm?t=1757354748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991650/extras/dc14478af848369e15cb5c2f7db25944.mp4?t=1757354748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve Puzzles! -\u00a0</strong>Study your surroundings, and take notes as you explore! Turn some dials! Toggle some switches! Crack locks and uh\u2026 sort socks! Yes! Maybe you\u2019ll even pack a few suitcases! And don\u2019t worry, if you ever need a hint, Vic the crow has got your back! \u201c\u2026for a small fee\u201d ;)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991650/extras/e17f38e78dd516252af759130006a4a1.poster.avif?t=1757354748\" width=1170 height=654 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991650/extras/e17f38e78dd516252af759130006a4a1.webm?t=1757354748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991650/extras/e17f38e78dd516252af759130006a4a1.mp4?t=1757354748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Switch Characters on the Fly! -\u00a0</strong>You\u2019ll need to swap between the two girls if you want to solve the game\u2019s trickiest puzzles! Letty has her own wing of the mansion to explore, where she\u2019ll turn up additional clues, special items, and even unlock secret passages for Melony as she ventures deeper into the past!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991650/extras/b2e0c5ec7d29a1c2cb8a737d76564dff.poster.avif?t=1757354748\" width=1170 height=654 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991650/extras/b2e0c5ec7d29a1c2cb8a737d76564dff.webm?t=1757354748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991650/extras/b2e0c5ec7d29a1c2cb8a737d76564dff.mp4?t=1757354748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tinker With Old Tech!</strong>\u00a0- School Night S\u00e9ance is filled to the brim with old technology; from floppy disks and VHS cassettes, to radios and rotary phones! (We\u2019ve even got a theremin!) Take some time to fiddle around with these thingamajigs and doo-dads and you\u2019ll be rewarded with CULTURE (and some story, sure, why not?)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet Ghosts!</strong>\u00a0- With Melony\u2019s flashlight, she\u2019s able to see ghosts! Most of these ghosts are reasonable enough folks with troubles of their own. Help them solve their problems and they\u2019ll be on their merry way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991650/extras/81c40dd9207afd6d838b3cf37cda46b5.poster.avif?t=1757354748\" width=1170 height=654 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991650/extras/81c40dd9207afd6d838b3cf37cda46b5.webm?t=1757354748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991650/extras/81c40dd9207afd6d838b3cf37cda46b5.mp4?t=1757354748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IN ADDITION TO...</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful hand drawn art and backgrounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A diverse cast of quirky characters, each fully voiced in order to bring them to life</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rich, character driven story centered around a family of inventors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plenty of collectibles, including phone numbers you can call on the rotary phone</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026And Vic the crow! <strong>(DON\u2019T FORGET ABOUT ME!!!)</strong> <i>(Friendship available upon payment. No refunds, no flash photography, and certainly no hugs.)</i></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3991650?t=1757354748","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991650/4f8165acb4378d7c9e0ff1b2b3c03720ded42782/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757354748","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991650/ad0dde76e1257176964069fa9639cb8b3f4fe07f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757354748","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991650/ad0dde76e1257176964069fa9639cb8b3f4fe07f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757354748","categories":[{"description":"Single-playe