 she\u2019s able to see ghosts! Most of these ghosts are reasonable enough folks with troubles of their own. Help them solve their problems and they\u2019ll be on their merry way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991650/extras/81c40dd9207afd6d838b3cf37cda46b5.poster.avif?t=1757354748\" width=1170 height=654 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991650/extras/81c40dd9207afd6d838b3cf37cda46b5.webm?t=1757354748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991650/extras/81c40dd9207afd6d838b3cf37cda46b5.mp4?t=1757354748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IN ADDITION TO...</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful hand drawn art and backgrounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A diverse cast of quirky characters, each fully voiced in order to bring them to life</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rich, character driven story centered around a family of inventors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plenty of collectibles, including phone numbers you can call on the rotary phone</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026And Vic the crow! <strong>(DON\u2019T FORGET ABOUT ME!!!)</strong> <i>(Friendship available upon payment. No refunds, no flash photography, and certainly no hugs.)</i></p></li></ul>","developers":["Ghosts in the Garden"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991650/9592f29332831d65fa6c6feb1b018845f50d056c/header.jpg?t=1757354748","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimu